[TestRequireAsyncDisposable/invalid-1 - 1]
Diagnostic 1: mustClose (9:3 - 11:3)
Message: '[Symbol.asyncDispose]' must 'await this.close()' so the AbortController is aborted and in-flight work settles.
Help: Add 'await this.close();' as the last statement.
   8 | class Service extends ADisposable {
   9 |   async [Symbol.asyncDispose](): Promise<void> {
     |   ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
  10 |     await work();
     | ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
  11 |   }
     | ~~~
  12 | }
---

[TestRequireAsyncDisposable/invalid-2 - 1]
Diagnostic 1: mustCloseLast (10:5 - 10:23)
Message: 'await this.close()' must be the last statement of '[Symbol.asyncDispose]' so the AbortController is aborted only after everything else settled.
Help: Move it to the end of the method.
   9 |   async [Symbol.asyncDispose](): Promise<void> {
  10 |     await this.close();
     |     ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
  11 |     await work();
